				6
			],
			"Message": "chore(build): update toolchain submodules to latest versions\n\n- Updates Biome (formatter/linter), Microsoft (TypeScript/VS Code core), OXC (JavaScript parser),\n  Rolldown (Rust bundler), SWC (compiler), and Vercel (frontend tooling) submodules\n- Aligns with recent upstream improvements in JavaScript toolchain performance and stability\n- Ensures Land's architecture leverages latest optimizations in Rust-based tooling critical for:\n  - Faster extension host bundling via Rolldown\n  - More accurate AST processing through OXC/SWC updates\n  - Improved linting/formatting rules from Biome\n  - Compatibility with latest VS Code extension APIs via Microsoft submodule\n- Maintains momentum toward MVP goals by keeping foundational dependencies current",
